## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates the ability to reason about cross-DC trust relationships, ACLs, and inter-DC interoperability under load, emphasizing practical debugging steps over theoretical knowledge.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-DC mTLS validation and certificate trust chain verification
- Consul ACLs and intentions across datacenters
- Mesh gateway and WAN gossip behavior under high churn
- Diagnosis under peak load conditions and rollback procedures

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: quick cross-DC health fetch
async function health(dc, svc) {
  const r = await fetch(`http://${svc}.${dc}.consul:443/v1/health`, {
    headers: { 'X-Consul-Token': process.env.CONSUL_TOKEN }
  });
  return r.json();
}

// Parallel health check across DCs
const results = await Promise.allSettled([
  health('k8s-prod', 'analytics-core'),
  health('k8s-dev', 'reporting-service')
]);
```
